{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cShe\u2019s waiting. She always is. Just one more visit.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Optasia: The Last Visit</strong></i> is a first-person psychological narrative experience set in a place that remembers more than it should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at an isolated asylum to see someone you care about. The halls are quiet. The furniture seems familiar. The clocks are wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no puzzles. No enemies.<br>Just rooms that shift when you aren\u2019t looking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore fading memories, echoing promises, and places that shouldn\u2019t exist\u00a0 or maybe never did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up tapes you don\u2019t remember recording.<br>Read letters no one ever sent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some doors open. Others say \u201cNot Yet.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time slips. Faces blur.<br>And somewhere in this place\u2026 is the moment you missed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you find the truth? Or just visit it one more time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018570/extras/30e65163d389fa6ed7fb1593f81174bd.avif?t=1774015639\" width=400 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven exploration</strong> \u2013 uncover a deeply personal story across multiple phases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamlike atmosphere</strong> \u2013 surreal environments, shifting rooms, and symbolic imagery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found materials</strong> \u2013 discover tapes, letters, and forgotten belongings that bring whispers of the past to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional storytelling</strong> \u2013 crafted to linger long after the final moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but impactful experience</strong> \u2013 designed to be completed in a single sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optasia: The Last Visit is about <strong>the weight of absence</strong>\u2014about the visits we make, and the ones we miss.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018570?t=1774015639","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018570?t=1774015639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018570/ed8dd86f189197cb6737d6f955cc1aa75b64c4e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774015639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018570/ed8dd86f189197cb6737d6f955cc1aa75b64c4e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774015639","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4032750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cShe\u2019s waiting. She always is. Just one more visit.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Optasia: The Last Visit</strong></i> is a first-person psychological narrative experience set in a place that remembers more than it should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at an isolated asylum to see someone you care about. The halls are quiet. The furniture seems familiar. The clocks are wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no puzzles. No enemies.<br>Just rooms that shift when you aren\u2019t looking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore fading memories, echoing promises, and places that shouldn\u2019t exist\u00a0 or maybe never did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up tapes you don\u2019t remember recording.<br>Read letters no one ever sent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some doors open. Others say \u201cNot Yet.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time slips. Faces blur.<br>And somewhere in this place\u2026 is the moment you missed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you find the truth? Or just visit it one more time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018570/extras/30e65163d389fa6ed7fb1593f81174bd.avif?t=1774015639\" width=400 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven exploration</strong> \u2013 uncover a deeply personal story across multiple phases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamlike atmosphere</strong> \u2013 surreal environments, shifting rooms, and symbolic imagery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found materials</strong> \u2013 discover tapes, letters, and forgotten belongings that bring whispers of the past to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional storytelling</strong> \u2013 crafted to linger long after the final moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but impactful experience</strong> \u2013 designed to be completed in a single sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optasia: The Last Visit is about <strong>the weight of absence</strong>\u2014about the visits we make, and the ones we miss.</p>","developers":["Optasia Studio "],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018570/c8cf198bc16f689df630d99c6a8381c8a3c49d7f/header.jpg?t=17740156